      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMa65xx Embedded Cortex®-A53 module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on AM65xx for applications with enhanced real-time requirements.</h1>\n<p>The TQMa65xx Embedded Module, built on ARM Cortex-A53 technology from Texas Instruments, is tailored to meet the real-time requirements of various applications. It features graphics with HD support and DDR4 with ECC support, making it suitable for display and touch applications. With up to 6 Gigabit Ethernet interfaces supported by Programmable Realtime Units (PRUs), it excels in real-time applications. It also boasts 2 Cortex R5 controllers for enhanced security and safety. This versatile module offers multiple CPU variants, extensive memory options, and a wide range of communication interfaces, making it a powerful choice for embedded computing engineers.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:36:38 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
