     "table": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td><div><span style=\"font-size: 13.125px;\"><b>CPU</b></span></div>\n</td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>CPU/Processor: Cortex®-A53 - Up to 1,1GHz</li>\n<li>CPU variant:</li>\n<li>AM6526 Dual</li>\n<li>AM6528 Dual</li>\n<li>AM6546 Quad</li>\n<li>AM6548 Quad</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Memory</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>DDR4: Up to 4 GB<ul>\n<li>ECC protection (optional)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Quad SPI NOR: Up to 256 MB</li>\n<li>EEPROM: 0/64-kbit</li>\n<li>eMMC: Up to 64 GB</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Graphics</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Graphics: LCD Interface: 1x 24bit RGB LCD, 1x LVDS</li>\n<li>Camera: 1x MIPI CSI2, 1x 16-bit Video IN</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Communications Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Ethernet:</li>\n<li>Up to 6x Ethernet 1000 Mbit (PRU)</li>\n<li>1x Ethernet 10/100/1000 Mbit</li>\n<li>USB:</li>\n<li>Up to 1x USB 3.1 interface</li>\n<li>Up to 1x USB 2.0 interface</li>\n<li>CAN: Up to 2x CAN FD</li>\n<li>Serial Ports: Up to 5x UART</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>Other Interfaces</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>SD Card: Up to 2x SDIO/MMC</li>\n<li>PCIe: Up to 2x PCIe 3.0</li>\n<li>I2C: Up to 6x I2C</li>\n<li>SPI:</li>\n<li>Up to 2x QSPI</li>\n<li>Up to 8x SPI</li>\n<li>GPIO: Up to 32x GPIO</li>\n<li>I2S: Up to 3x McASP/I2S</li>\n<li>ADC: Up to 2x ADC channel (12bit)</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>General</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Temperature range:</li>\n<li>Standard temperature range: -25°C…+85°C</li>\n<li>Extended temperature: -40°C…+85°C</li>\n<li>Dimensions: 77 mm x 55 mm</li>\n<li>Plug-in System: Board-to-board plug-in system 560 pins 0.5 mm Pitch</li>\n<li>Temperature sensor</li>\n<li>Power supply: 5 V</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr><tr><td><b>OS</b></td>\n<td><ul>\n<li>Linux</li>\n<li>QNX on request</li>\n<li>Android on request</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr></tbody></table>",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:37:17 GMT+0000",
